# Carbium credentials. Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored.
#
# One key from https://carbium.sh covers every recipe in this repo.
#
#   RPC        https://services.carbium.sh/?api-key=<CARBIUM_SH_KEY>
#   WebSocket  wss://services.carbium.sh/?api-key=<CARBIUM_SH_KEY>
#   Swap API   https://services.carbium.sh   header: x-api-key: <CARBIUM_SH_KEY>
#
# The Swap API recipes need the Quote module on the account. Add it on
# carbium.sh under MODULES.
#
# The Carbon Stream (gRPC) recipes need a Dev plan or above and the gRPC scope on
# the key: carbium.sh, Keys, SCOPE, select GRPC.
#   Carbon Stream  https://services.carbium.sh:9443   metadata: x-token: <CARBIUM_SH_KEY>
#
# Paste the full key (c_serv_...), not the short prefix the dashboard lists.
# When the key travels in the URL query string, the whole connection URL is a
# secret. Build it from the key at runtime and never log it.

CARBIUM_SH_KEY=
